+
+| Candidate | Status |
+|---|---|
+| Ministral 3 3B Instruct 2512 | PASS, prior evidence retained |
+| Qwen3 4B | PASS, prior evidence retained; `enable_thinking=false` |
+| Qwen2.5 3B Instruct | PASS, prior evidence retained |
